            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>There is provided a humidity sensor structure comprising a silicon substrate (12), a support layer (14) formed on the silicon substrate (12), and an active sensor (22). The support layer (14) comprises thickness of 100-1000 nm, and the active sensor (22) comprises thickness of 1-100 µm.</p>
